# Local configuration template — no real values.
#
# The current prototype reads NO environment variables: neither the FastAPI app
# nor the OCR pipeline or CLI loads configuration from the environment. This file
# documents the variables a future secure deployment would need, so that no real
# credentials are ever committed. Uncomment and set values only in a local,
# git-ignored `.env` (see .gitignore) once the corresponding feature exists.
#
# None of these variables are consumed by the code today. Setting them has no
# effect, and doing so must not be reported as implemented configuration.

# --- Planned: authentication / authorization (NOT implemented) ---
# OIDC_ISSUER=
# OIDC_CLIENT_ID=
# OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET=

# --- Planned: private document storage (NOT implemented) ---
# DOCUMENT_STORAGE_BACKEND=
# DOCUMENT_STORAGE_BUCKET=
# DOCUMENT_STORAGE_ACCESS_KEY=
# DOCUMENT_STORAGE_SECRET_KEY=

# --- Planned: audit log / retention (NOT implemented) ---
# AUDIT_LOG_BACKEND=
# RETENTION_DAYS=

# --- Planned: optional OCR engine tuning (defaults are hard-coded today) ---
# TESSERACT_LANGUAGE=eng
# TESSERACT_MAX_BYTES=10485760
